From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: sivnag <sivnag@qti.qualcomm.com>
Date: Mon, 18 Aug 2026 00:00:00 +0530
Subject: [PATCH] qca-hostap: Skip selecting a WPS AP on 6 GHz

WPS is not supported on 6 GHz band. Skip selecting a WPS AP
when the BSS is on a 6 GHz frequency to avoid unnecessary
WPS processing and connection attempts on 6 GHz.

CR-Fixed: 4648027
Change-Id: I4bb540a5b8a71c62bc6c2ab37edb4ea5501517e0
Signed-off-by: Sivanandhini Nagarathinam <sivnag@qti.qualcomm.com>
---
 wpa_supplicant/wps_supplicant.c | 6 ++++++
 1 file changed, 6 insertions(+)

diff --git a/wpa_supplicant/wps_supplicant.c b/wpa_supplicant/wps_supplicant.c
--- a/wpa_supplicant/wps_supplicant.c
+++ b/wpa_supplicant/wps_supplicant.c
@@ -1808,6 +1808,12 @@ int wpas_wps_ssid_bss_match(struct wpa_supplicant *wpa_s,
 		if (!wps_ie) {
 			wpa_printf(MSG_DEBUG, "   skip - non-WPS AP");
 			return 0;
 		}

+		if (is_6ghz_freq(bss->freq)) {
+			wpa_printf(MSG_DEBUG, "   skip - WPS AP "
+				   "in 6GHz");
+			wpabuf_free(wps_ie);
+			return 0;
+		}
 		if (!wps_is_selected_pbc_registrar(wps_ie)) {
 			wpa_printf(MSG_DEBUG, "   skip - WPS AP "
 				   "without active PBC Registrar");
--
2.34.1
